<view class="page" style="font-size:{{fontPx}}px"><view class="back" bindtap="back">‹ 返回</view><view class="brand"><text class="brand-mark">七</text><view class="title">七叔行业平台</view></view><view class="subtitle" style="margin:24rpx 0 40rpx">连接适合的货源，找到可用的经营方法</view>
 <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">微信登录</view><view class="muted">登录建立账号身份，不自动读取昵称或手机号。手机号需单独授权，经营资质需另行审核。正式登录需要有效AppID和服务端凭证。</view><view class="row" style="margin-top:24rpx"><view wx:for="{{roles}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{authRole===item.id?'active':''}}" data-role="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseRole">{{item.title}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{authRole==='admin'}}" class="notice">平台管理员须先核验手机号并由平台授权。选择此身份不会自行开通管理权限；后台为独立Web工作空间。</view><button class="primary full-btn" bindtap="wechat" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">微信登录</button></view>
 <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
 <view class="panel" wx:if="{{demoEnabled}}"><view class="card-title">开发演示入口</view><view class="notice">以下为服务端测试账号，不代表真实微信登录或经营资质认证。正式发布前必须关闭开发演示登录。</view><button class="secondary full-btn" bindtap="demo" disabled="{{busy}}">使用当前身份进行开发测试</button></view>
 <view class="panel" wx:if="{{demoEnabled}}"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">开发服务地址</text><input placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:4188" value="{{apiBase}}" bindinput="baseInput"/></view><button bindtap="saveBase">保存服务地址</button><view class="tiny">真机不能把手机的127.0.0.1当电脑。局域网调试请使用电脑局域网地址；正式环境必须部署HTTPS并满足微信域名要求。</view></view>
</view>
